<title>NEPAL: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEPAL GOVERNMENT LIST (970312)</p>
<p> Head of State.....King BIRENDRA</p>
<p> Crown Prince........Prince DIPENDRA Bir Bikram</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Formed 12 Mar 97):</p>
<p>(See end of list for party affiliations)</p>
<p>Prime Minister....Lokendra Bahadur CHAND (RPP)</p>
<p>(Sworn in 12 Mar 97)</p>
<p>(Also Defence &amp; Royal Palace Affairs Minister)</p>
<p>Deputy Prime Minister.....Bam Dev GAUTAM (UML)</p>
<p>(Also Home (interior); Industries; Population &amp;</p>
<p>Environment; Works &amp; Transport; Tourism &amp; Civil Aviation;</p>
<p>Youth, Sports &amp; Culture; Education; Labour; Parliamentary</p>
<p>Affairs; Information, Communication &amp; General</p>
<p>Administration)</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Defence......See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Education............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Finance; Housing &amp; Physical Planning; Agriculture; Water</p>
<p> Resources; Foreign Affairs; Land Reform &amp; Management;</p>
<p>     Commerce........Rabindra Nath SHARMA (RPP)</p>
<p> Forest &amp; Soil Conservation...............Sahana PRADHAN (UML)</p>
<p> Health.............Radha Krishna MAINALI (UML)</p>
<p> Home (Interior)......See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Industries...........See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Information, Communication &amp;</p>
<p>     General Administration..........See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Labour...............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Law &amp; Justice, Women &amp; Social</p>
<p>     Welfare.........Rameshwar Raya YADAV (NSP)</p>
<p> Local Development.....Amrit Kumar BOHARA (UML)</p>
<p> Parliamentary Affairs...............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Population &amp; Environment............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Royal Palace Affairs........See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Supplies, Science &amp; Technology...Gajendra Narayan SINGH (NSP)</p>
<p> Tourism &amp; Civil Aviation............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Works &amp; Transport....See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p> Youth, Sports &amp; Culture.............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p>- - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p>RPP -- Rastriya Prajatantra Party</p>
<p>UML -- United Marxist-Leninist party</p>
<p>NSP -- Nepal Sadbhavana Party</p>
<p>			   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor.Satyendra Pyara SHRESTHA</p>
